{"4889740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mow My World", "steam_appid": 4889740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [4897080, 4897090, 4897100, 4897110, 4981010, 4981030], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889740/extras/a4d67a8224077d1c5adc3c5585b59ed9.avif?t=1784521126\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889740/extras_big/a4d67a8224077d1c5adc3c5585b59ed9.avif?t=1784521126 width=1560 height=438 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mow It. Plow It. Tow It. Fly It.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Mow My World</u></strong> puts modular CCBOT robots to work across Earth, the Moon, and Mars. Take on service jobs, upgrade your fleet, build your own places, and switch into AirMode when the job calls for a view from above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889740/extras/fdc9e42df93ecec6c59e59288eac5152.poster.avif?t=1784521126\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889740/extras/fdc9e42df93ecec6c59e59288eac5152.webm?t=1784521126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889740/extras/fdc9e42df93ecec6c59e59288eac5152.mp4?t=1784521126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mow, Plow &amp; Tow</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut lunar grass, clear snow on Mars, and haul cargo across Earth. Each job gives your robot a different purpose, from clean service routes to heavy-duty work across changing terrain.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889740/extras/962820a2c10e995abf975063e24df7ef.poster.avif?t=1784521126\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889740/extras/962820a2c10e995abf975063e24df7ef.webm?t=1784521126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889740/extras/962820a2c10e995abf975063e24df7ef.mp4?t=1784521126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take Off With AirMode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the ground is not enough, deploy AirMode. Lift off, scout the map, line up your next route, and capture cinematic shots of your robot at work from above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889740/extras/76d8482021cd1b32029c1105f49954cd.poster.avif?t=1784521126\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889740/extras/76d8482021cd1b32029c1105f49954cd.webm?t=1784521126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889740/extras/76d8482021cd1b32029c1105f49954cd.mp4?t=1784521126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weather, Light &amp; Off-World Atmosphere</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear days, night work, snow, rain, lunar sunrise, and dusty Martian skies change the feeling of every job. Turn on your robot lights and keep working when the world gets dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889740/extras/24230e9bf818c3a7ade0ea46d3c4bf95.poster.avif?t=1784521126\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889740/extras/24230e9bf818c3a7ade0ea46d3c4bf95.webm?t=1784521126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889740/extras/24230e9bf818c3a7ade0ea46d3c4bf95.mp4?t=1784521126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Real Maps Become Playable</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a supported address and turn a real-world place into a playable work site. Mow lawns and save neighborhoods you want to revisit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889740/extras/13c545deea05033b7f34251cadf37ad8.poster.avif?t=1784521126\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889740/extras/13c545deea05033b7f34251cadf37ad8.webm?t=1784521126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889740/extras/13c545deea05033b7f34251cadf37ad8.mp4?t=1784521126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Visit Landmarks Across Worlds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your robot to hand-built landmark scenes across Earth, the Moon, and Mars. These scenic places are made for exploration, AirMode, and cinematic service jobs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889740/extras/58f38afb0e5f13991a08cb322ebb1061.poster.avif?t=1784521126\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889740/extras/58f38afb0e5f13991a08cb322ebb1061.webm?t=1784521126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889740/extras/58f38afb0e5f13991a08cb322ebb1061.mp4?t=1784521126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Practice Before The Job</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into practice areas to test modules, learn controls, try AirMode, and get comfortable before taking on real map jobs. The last but not the least, use blocks to build, test, and play your own creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889740/extras/a4d67a8224077d1c5adc3c5585b59ed9.avif?t=1784521126\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889740/extras_big/a4d67a8224077d1c5adc3c5585b59ed9.avif?t=1784521126 width=1560 height=438 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mow It. Plow It. Tow It. Fly It.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Mow My World</u></strong> puts modular CCBOT robots to work across Earth, the Moon, and Mars. Take on service jobs, upgrade your fleet, build your own places, and switch into AirMode when the job calls for a view from above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889740/extras/fdc9e42df93ecec6c59e59288eac5152.poster.avif?t=1784521126\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889740/extras/fdc9e42df93ecec6c59e59288eac5152.webm?t=1784521126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889740/extras/fdc9e42df93ecec6c59e59288eac5152.mp4?t=1784521126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mow, Plow &amp; Tow</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut lunar grass, clear snow on Mars, and haul cargo across Earth. Each job gives your robot a different purpose, from clean service routes to heavy-duty work across changing terrain.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889740/extras/962820a2c10e995abf975063e24df7ef.poster.avif?t=1784521126\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889740/extras/962820a2c10e995abf975063e24df7ef.webm?t=1784521126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889740/extras/962820a2c10e995abf975063e24df7ef.mp4?t=1784521126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take Off With AirMode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the ground is not enough, deploy AirMode. Lift off, scout the map, line up your next route, and capture cinematic shots of your robot at work from above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889740/extras/76d8482021cd1b32029c1105f49954cd.poster.avif?t=1784521126\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889740/extras/76d8482021cd1b32029c1105f49954cd.webm?t=1784521126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889740/extras/76d8482021cd1b32029c1105f49954cd.mp4?t=1784521126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weather, Light &amp; Off-World Atmosphere</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear days, night work, snow, rain, lunar sunrise, and dusty Martian skies change the feeling of every job. Turn on your robot lights and keep working when the world gets dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889740/extras/24230e9bf818c3a7ade0ea46d3c4bf95.poster.avif?t=1784521126\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889740/extras/24230e9bf818c3a7ade0ea46d3c4bf95.webm?t=1784521126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889740/extras/24230e9bf818c3a7ade0ea46d3c4bf95.mp4?t=1784521126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Real Maps Become Playable</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a supported address and turn a real-world place into a playable work site. Mow lawns and save neighborhoods you want to revisit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889740/extras/13c545deea05033b7f34251cadf37ad8.poster.avif?t=1784521126\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889740/extras/13c545deea05033b7f34251cadf37ad8.webm?t=1784521126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889740/extras/13c545deea05033b7f34251cadf37ad8.mp4?t=1784521126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Visit Landmarks Across Worlds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your robot to hand-built landmark scenes across Earth, the Moon, and Mars. These scenic places are made for exploration, AirMode, and cinematic service jobs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889740/extras/58f38afb0e5f13991a08cb322ebb1061.poster.avif?t=1784521126\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889740/extras/58f38afb0e5f13991a08cb322ebb1061.webm?t=1784521126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889740/extras/58f38afb0e5f13991a08cb322ebb1061.mp4?t=1784521126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Practice Before The Job</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into practice areas to test modules, learn controls, try AirMode, and get comfortable before taking on real map jobs. The last but not the least, use blocks to build, test, and play your own creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Mow My World is a free-to-play modular robotic platform sandbox where you mow lawns, clear snow, tow cargo, fly in AirMode, build with blocks, and explore landmarks across Earth, the Moon, and Mars. Load real-world maps, save neighborhoods, and turn public places into playable communities.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889740/10d821c6da0cd012eaf164007a851f5528d57b24/header.jpg?t=1784521126", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889740/cb63f120ca8728109bb9e3a072eb8fee6ea9bfbf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784521126", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889740/cb63f120ca8728109bb9e3a072eb8fee6ea9bfbf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784521126", "website": "https://botdancegames.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit p